WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.185 --> 00:00:01.101
- Ever since I was a little girl

00:00:01.101 --> 00:00:02.613
I've believed in fairytales,

00:00:02.613 --> 00:00:04.315
and magic and all that kinda thing.

00:00:04.315 --> 00:00:06.756
When it came time to come up with a saying

00:00:06.756 --> 00:00:09.201
or phrase to validate black women

00:00:09.201 --> 00:00:11.321
to speak about greatness,

00:00:11.321 --> 00:00:12.428
black girls are magic,

00:00:12.428 --> 00:00:13.625
it just made sense to me.

00:00:13.625 --> 00:00:16.375
(dramatic music)

00:00:26.203 --> 00:00:27.847
First thing I envision is women

00:00:27.847 --> 00:00:30.096
who are black women specifically,

00:00:30.096 --> 00:00:32.056
just making a way outta no way.

00:00:32.056 --> 00:00:33.799
By coming into their own,

00:00:33.799 --> 00:00:37.656
being self-sufficient, extraordinarily so.

00:00:37.656 --> 00:00:40.972
And just being amazing,
under all circumstances,

00:00:40.972 --> 00:00:41.933
and any circumstances.

00:00:41.933 --> 00:00:43.899
Anything you could possibly think of

00:00:43.899 --> 00:00:46.196
a black woman has been able to do it

00:00:46.196 --> 00:00:49.044
and do it in a way that
makes people take note.

00:00:49.044 --> 00:00:50.459
- When I hear black girl magic

00:00:50.459 --> 00:00:54.000
I see bold women, confident women,

00:00:54.000 --> 00:00:57.067
women that are also able to be vulnerable,

00:00:57.067 --> 00:00:58.824
but also stand in who they are

00:00:58.824 --> 00:01:01.252
and be confident and own who they are.

00:01:01.252 --> 00:01:04.745
- Black girl magic is
complete feminine power,

00:01:04.745 --> 00:01:07.028
complete goddess power,

00:01:07.028 --> 00:01:09.016
tapping into your melanin in your DNA

00:01:09.016 --> 00:01:11.277
to activate your ancestors,

00:01:11.277 --> 00:01:13.909
to activate your true self purpose.

00:01:13.909 --> 00:01:17.191
- Black girl magic is just
the epitome of being yourself,

00:01:17.191 --> 00:01:19.523
being awesome, being amazing,

00:01:19.523 --> 00:01:22.239
and just embodying that
in every way possible.

00:01:22.239 --> 00:01:25.032
- I think just black
girls or black cis girls,

00:01:25.032 --> 00:01:27.573
black trans girls, just doing
what feels good for them.

00:01:27.573 --> 00:01:29.224
- [CaShawn Thompson] I hope
they feel pride in themselves

00:01:29.224 --> 00:01:31.031
and pride in other black women.

00:01:31.031 --> 00:01:32.529
It's just, it's so important to me

00:01:32.529 --> 00:01:35.203
that we feel validated and uplifted.

00:01:35.203 --> 00:01:38.036
Cause there's so many negatives out there.

00:01:38.036 --> 00:01:39.452
I want us to always be able

00:01:39.452 --> 00:01:41.104
to have something positive

00:01:41.104 --> 00:01:42.573
to hold on to for ourselves.

00:01:42.573 --> 00:01:44.846
- First time I heard black girl magic

00:01:44.846 --> 00:01:47.041
it made me feel tied

00:01:47.041 --> 00:01:50.241
to all the brown girls around the world.

00:01:50.241 --> 00:01:51.458
- I think it's the way we walk,

00:01:51.458 --> 00:01:52.913
I think it's the way we dress.

00:01:52.913 --> 00:01:54.028
- I think black girl magic

00:01:54.028 --> 00:01:56.345
is something, a spark almost.

00:01:56.345 --> 00:01:57.646
Something extra little oomph

00:01:57.646 --> 00:01:59.640
that we put into everything that we do.

00:01:59.640 --> 00:02:00.608
- When you see a black woman,

00:02:00.608 --> 00:02:01.741
you see all of black culture.

00:02:01.741 --> 00:02:04.633
- Black girl magic is
the ability to overcome,

00:02:04.633 --> 00:02:08.179
the ability to do amazing boss ass shit,

00:02:08.179 --> 00:02:09.321
with very little.

00:02:09.321 --> 00:02:10.756
- [CaShawn Thompson] The
black girl magic hashtag

00:02:10.756 --> 00:02:13.649
is about celebration and
triumph over struggle,

00:02:13.649 --> 00:02:15.629
but it's not just one or the other,

00:02:15.629 --> 00:02:16.462
it's all those things,

00:02:16.462 --> 00:02:18.142
cause we encompass all those things.

00:02:18.142 --> 00:02:20.263
Our struggles build us up,

00:02:20.263 --> 00:02:21.937
but so do our celebrations

00:02:21.937 --> 00:02:24.744
and all the happiness
and joy we experience,

00:02:24.744 --> 00:02:27.151
and all those things that
come along with being,

00:02:27.151 --> 00:02:30.107
you know, multi ability humans,

00:02:30.107 --> 00:02:31.407
everything that comes along

00:02:31.407 --> 00:02:34.404
with being more than just one thing.

00:02:34.404 --> 00:02:37.154
(dramatic music)

